            "content": "# Install guide\n\nRun `pirc node`, then **restart** the _service_. See [the setup page](http://127.0.0.1:<site-port>/docs/setup?x=1#top) or [an external page](https://example.com/external). Script link and an empty link.\n\nLine one\nLine two\n\n---\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Download\n2. Configure\n  - Edit `config.json`\n  - Set the token\n    1. Copy it\n    2. Paste it\n3. Start\n\n### Options\n\n| Name | Default |\n| --- | --- |\n| PIRC_BROWSER | true |\n| a \\| b | spaced out |\n\n```\ncargo build --release\n./target/release/pirc-node\n```\n\n> Quoted first.\n>\n>\n>\n> Quoted second.\n\n![Logo](http://127.0.0.1:<site-port>/logo.png)\n\nSearch\n\nMore\n\nTerm\n\nDefinition\n\n- Stray item\n\n#### Heading **bold** _italic_\n\n##### Five\n\n###### Six",
